Package: codex-plusplus-linux
Version: 0.1.1
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: nodejs (>= 20) | nodejs, npm, tar, desktop-file-utils
Maintainer: Doved and Codex++ Linux contributors <davidpavlovschi@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/davidpavlovschi/codex-plusplus-linux
Description: Unofficial OpenAI Codex desktop app with Codex++ tweaks for Linux
 Installs a desktop launcher and CLI wrapper that downloads the unofficial
 Linux Codex desktop shell, installs the OpenAI Codex CLI runtime, injects
 Codex++ tweaks, pins the app on Cinnamon when available, and writes per-user
 logs.
